{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1000_null", "source_sha256": "999cb6e61aa222cdd00dfd3cd6df5b2e47ca7afa83d2f745258130e0270f6eca", "ja": "2週間前……", "zh": "2周前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "cff2926e46c7cd37722a54d5a124d32122cdb31ff5d670f8fa939186b41b5d75", "ja": "それでは、撮影内容の説明をさせていただきます。\n簡単に言うと、陣地取りゲームです！", "zh": "那么，接下来为您说明拍摄内容。\n简单来说，就是抢地盘游戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1002_staff", "source_sha256": "a4f9ebf9c9d8070c40d8d6facac01e408e18737ac72eba1acf0e896eef0c5bac", "ja": "みなさんにはそれぞれの砂の城を守っていただきます。\n最後まで自分の城を守り抜けた人が優勝です！", "zh": "请各位守护好各自的沙堡。\n坚持守护自己的城堡到最后的人获胜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1003_p", "source_sha256": "63b11c40b91b1baa4beb341a56042e492ca495c99a480fd244720d250bc981be", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、バラエティ番組の収録。\n先方のたっての希望で、衣装は水着だ）", "zh": "（今天的工作是录制综艺节目。由于对方强烈要求，服装是泳装）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a77e7fd76b1f1455c3b8fb1e91b115afc013ed1e09a9e6b24f707fa63e68c24f", "ja": "（一応、みんなOKしてくれたけど……\n過剰な演出にならないよう、しっかり見ていないと）", "zh": "（大家姑且都答应了……但还是得仔细盯着，不能让演出过于夸张）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8facf92992d7d801ec3580deacfa27d71ca943295f56265ca42968b6071ed530", "ja": "えっと、とにかくお城を守ればいいんだよね……\nきゃあっ！？　み、水！？　どこから！？", "zh": "那个，总之只要守住城堡就可以了吧……\n呀！？ 水、水！？ 从哪里冒出来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "282a7337ad0bcf3de57b7756d32bb423d22f15343a2ed2bd49b6b92e84eff881", "ja": "へへっ。ごめんね～、風花！\nでも、これで1ポイントゲット！", "zh": "嘿嘿。对不起啦～风花！\n不过这样就能拿到1分啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "293f3d9f15c851eb720fa91768c560863b8e0c3a43e9c6861f39468d28a8488c", "ja": "近くの水の流れを変えて、城を攻めるなんて……\nさすが恵美、油断ならないぞ！", "zh": "改变附近水流的方向来攻城……不愧是惠美，真不能掉以轻心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "5498166b2a466f181d904678cdd4792ce89f490439d91a393bebfe93f85814c3", "ja": "やるじゃない、恵美ちゃん！　……ということで、\n千早ちゃん。ここはひとつ、同盟を組まない？", "zh": "真有一套呢，惠美！……既然如此，\n千早。我们要不要在这里结个盟？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "4573e8cf7f363139326b31829a42949b2c7bcfee4616440f39253e2c07f17066", "ja": "同盟……ですか？", "zh": "同盟……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "32dd9c84d72e5697ef74a4a06bbf0fcfd07cfadfef00769b8c8ad875e572caa1", "ja": "ええ。私たちはお隣同士。最後の2人になるまでは、\nお互いを攻撃しない……なんていうのはどうかしら。", "zh": "嗯。我们是邻居嘛。在剩下最后2个人之前，彼此不要互相攻击……这样的提议怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "2584643e664df2f0063cf27e02917e7197c0420b0bb48279d878c68930722c8e", "ja": "なるほど……わかりました。\nいいと思います、同盟。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白了。\n我觉得可以，就结盟吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "233ea8bbc7e74e2037d5765ebb068cb411c9ac027aa22a3bab1c17086f5d5f15", "ja": "交渉成立ね！　それじゃ、短い間だけどよろしく♪", "zh": "谈判成功！那么，虽然只能合作一小段时间，但请多关照啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1013_director", "source_sha256": "18b4fdbfea92d099972e001394e82f116d7e99ac3d01192a2456b10d19d3e276", "ja": "カーット！\n……うんうん。撮れ高、高いね～！　イイ感じ！", "zh": "咔——！\n……嗯嗯。收获满满呢～！感觉很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9d2977678f75b72c3e0c89b8aff28c92d078b127be1bfc03cf2f8a1c8dbc04e1", "ja": "（今のところ、撮影は上手くいっているな……\nおっと、電話だ）", "zh": "（目前拍摄进行得很顺利……哦，电话来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f06650d4053d2966b2e04aa725435c6b6fff458f17c696d2ed97a33ad7a34b97", "ja": "すみません、ちょっと電話してきます！\nみんな、タオルここに置いてあるから！", "zh": "抱歉，我去接个电话！\n大家，毛巾放在这里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "8594c26cc28a6fc6416c11ece8836f79a788e5c89cd743a5a4a037df77581636", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1017_director", "source_sha256": "51d36367792a3acdd2d10f4e9078dbdfa3a69d9155dd05847e6427449af32f29", "ja": "すみません！　さっきのやり取りですが、如月さんと\n馬場さんを抜きたいので、もう一回お願いします！", "zh": "不好意思！关于刚才那段对话，我想把如月小姐和马场小姐去掉，所以请再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "62e3683613039d23021f5df92b959e0628c6d48be2b3209325e4cd0a785d17cd", "ja": "えっ？　もう一回……ですか？", "zh": "诶？还要再来一次……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1019_director", "source_sha256": "c4128a2f0882b2b306b4dab68fa04592cf2f6a7f4de77a80318cb35da0d2d6b5", "ja": "すみません、もうちょっと強い画作りたくて！　可愛い\n馬場さんの、意外とカッコイイ感じが良かったですし。", "zh": "不好意思，我想营造出更有冲击力一点的画面！可爱的马场小姐那种意外帅气的感觉，就很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1020_director", "source_sha256": "f0b7fe26744046e0fa884f27366e1c0ec26bb25e6de8347c3952ce1a9b53bc50", "ja": "あっ、フレッシュでセンシティブな感じも\n出したいので、そこんとこよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "啊，我也想展现出清新又细腻的感觉，这方面就拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "b41ee8e0304d8dd9da89bd688c66e1f8f3d829b12b780beb1eec98e74e4b1861", "ja": "ふ、フレッシュでセンシティブ？\nあの、それはどういう……。", "zh": "新、新鲜又敏感？那个，这是什么意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "609580d9e0c52a1ea9621664c75a82abed649ea5945961cd30a7f923d4965ed0", "ja": "ちょっと、ディレクターさん！　アダルティな私に、\nフレッシュでセンシティブっておかしくない？", "zh": "等等，导演先生！明明我是成熟的大姐姐偶像，说我清新又敏感，不觉得很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "cb2c6f4efb6c289213c89b58bc3541689a0f8d8622c4010e00f424e0001b79a6", "ja": "私はセクシーさが売りのお姉さんアイドル、\n馬場このみなのに！", "zh": "明明我是以性感为卖点的姐姐系偶像，马场木实！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1024_director", "source_sha256": "66a2fafc40509203c21705da84ead91025c05c7c1047ba21660e2d87b3b2ab0b", "ja": "いや～。\n怒っても可愛らしいですね、馬場さんは！", "zh": "哎呀～。\n生起气来也很可爱呢，马场小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1025_stafftati", "source_sha256": "52f3e47767363d0c40a0c6bcfecf9fe828599865ee6b9725bc99500c28751709", "ja": "アハハハハ……！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "396eaf27fc1b0a85ef6484081a791f19c77810b685179438243fb32c78fb581a", "ja": "う～ん……。あの人たち、さっきから失礼じゃないか？\n特に、このみに対してひどいぞ……。", "zh": "嗯……那些人从刚才开始就有点失礼吧？\n尤其是对这位更过分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "d2d6c2eba357bc9645e3b5fc82bf6f666b7eef970898adb13703fad518bbae57", "ja": "アタシも思った。\nそれに、なーんか、やけにイジってこない？", "zh": "我也这么觉得。\n而且总感觉，他们是不是一直在拿我们开涮？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3c25f396c7339fd0ad4879bcd157729cfeeed680bcea0874495b4b4f56b47536", "ja": "うん……やっぱり、そう思うよね……。このみさん、\n{$P$}さんに相談してみますか？", "zh": "嗯……果然，你也这么觉得吧……。要不要去找{$P$}先生商量一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "30bb58df4da1e2ab2c1b47d88a945ebb19eee87b9111d19a6a4f3f07d5fa6407", "ja": "そうね……。台本を見せてもらった時も、\n今時珍しい内容だとは思ったけど……。", "zh": "是啊……我看剧本的时候，也觉得这内容在如今确实很少见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "8499803e5c97d194d0426b17a972b2696add2ef24ba5ca71e4b8d03b4f87877a", "ja": "……水着の撮影だから、テンションが上がって、\n気が大きくなっちゃってるのかもしれないわね。", "zh": "……毕竟是泳装拍摄，可能情绪一高涨，\n就变得得意忘形起来了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "13d39f8b30824e3b388879ddd885407a0461bd276957dbec454b8aa26450da9b", "ja": "よくわかりませんが……\nそういうものなんでしょうか？", "zh": "我不太明白……  \n是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "e3daa11bf899dadeefd1e1286665d6dfe721a278be4be249f824c5dd826d1e62", "ja": "ええ。それに、{$P$}がいる間は、\n気を付けて見ていてくれるもの。", "zh": "嗯。而且只要有{$P$}在，就会一直留意着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "1840b5e8461c1b5a0bc20c1081cbdeb62883b828fdc61ebb88363a847ea070fa", "ja": "私は大丈夫だから、みんな気にしないで？\nそれより、早く撮影終わらせちゃいましょ！", "zh": "我没事，大家不用担心我？比起这个，还是赶紧把拍摄结束吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "d96c050bfe944af3649bdcd6703fb80061756c980c650ac2786bac7e79bdba89", "ja": "このみ……うん、わかった。\nみんな、急いで終わらせるぞ！", "zh": "可奈……嗯，我知道了。\n大家，赶紧把拍摄结束吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1035_null", "source_sha256": "79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed", "ja": "撮影終了後……", "zh": "拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1036_p", "source_sha256": "97a60fcdb3a62e7c1dfbe3cc5c544d7ff3d809bd8ce3d44d73a8d0fdb8b13c37", "ja": "お疲れ様です、このみさん。風花から聞きました。\n今日の収録で色々あったそうで、すみませんでした。", "zh": "辛苦了，这个美。听风花说了。\n听说今天的录音出了不少状况，真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "ced901e3bdc871302413a8304e652adf523dcc14fa0c1ff38ea911df90e78834", "ja": "やだ、聞いちゃったの？\n大したことじゃないのに。", "zh": "讨厌，你都听说了呀？\n其实也没什么大不了的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1038_p", "source_sha256": "db012693f93e85a42a2ae777e3f5bfcb0a0eadcf1371d69ac68bb748d3e89d60", "ja": "あまり過激な事はしないよう、事前に\nお願いはしていたんですが……。", "zh": "我事先就拜托过她，不要做太过激的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "035ef6130552cc880aabc7aa856dfb4377e4a1cb473ab50dd7b32ef3f7d95457", "ja": "気にしなくていいのよ、{$P$}！\n私はお姉さんなんだから。", "zh": "不用在意啦，{$P$}！\n我可是姐姐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "cb8bb1f535fa08eb85fcc01961dd2554d1fef7b28ef7e91d49371a4f7576358b", "ja": "それに、水着のお仕事だってことは知ってて\n引き受けたし。ある程度、予想どおりだったわ。", "zh": "而且，我也是知道是泳装工作才接下来的。基本上和预想的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "5eb35fc329deec43678a8feca32d69a392fba7c89387b7c67a6c6b8fd51c47a3", "ja": "それより、次がどうとか聞こえたんだけど？\n出演のオファー？", "zh": "比起这个，我好像听到你说“下一次”什么的？\n是出演的邀约吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1042_p", "source_sha256": "1d9c247d7440b75adf9b0524d72bd87d3d2df787525c1cbac7244599ba6d96d8", "ja": "ええ、是非お願いしたいと……\nけど、次回もこのノリなら、断ろうと思っています。", "zh": "嗯，对方确实希望我们参加……\n不过，如果下次还是这种风格，我打算拒绝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "86cee20a5fa9ffc1cfe21e7080f82f8c0a23931b34c4bb51823c7d6bc81234d4", "ja": "何言ってるの、{$P$}！\n昔ほどじゃないとはいえ、民放の有名番組よ？", "zh": "你在说什么啊，{$P$}！  \n虽然比不上以前，但那可是民营电视台的知名节目啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "bdf87e69f17d886df4a16762d85f78fa6eac774c08f5ea3587e25a12ebabf433", "ja": "今時はネット配信も多いけど、やっぱり\nご年配の方への知名度は、TVじゃないとだし……。", "zh": "现在网络播出也很多，不过要让老年人知道，还是得上电视才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "6bddf4d2e5bfd576707f83739eca7b32852ced65e0ffd654ee59f39c67c09620", "ja": "みんなが嫌なら仕方ないけど、\n私だったら大丈夫！　遠慮することないわ。", "zh": "如果大家都不愿意，那也没办法，\n但换作是我的话没问题！不用客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1046_p", "source_sha256": "7d77917db7f218d3130867aa865dc1da1a5a1c0dee43aa5990b05b0313d025d5", "ja": "それはそうなんですが……\nこのみさん、無理してませんか？", "zh": "话是这么说没错……\n不过，这美小姐，你是不是在勉强自己？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1047_039kon", "source_sha256": "9eb8b6395420ad94bbcd6b3cb97ce15418058230585580773a3e222c0fed701b", "ja": "全然！　それより私、今、すっごくやる気なの。\nだから、どんどんお仕事取ってきてちょうだいね！", "zh": "完全没有！比起那个，我现在干劲十足呢。\n所以，尽管多给我接些工作来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1048_p", "source_sha256": "af57df33be04fe145b850320cd3ee833ecbdda8cbf3295a71615b3e861a14c2d", "ja": "そうですか……わかりました。\n少し、考えさせてください。", "zh": "这样啊……我明白了。\n请让我稍微考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1049_039kon", "source_sha256": "a294358b38160904bdd0920c3abac31b1fba6955cddb4df94b171fd540b51aba", "ja": "ええ、お願いね！", "zh": "嗯，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1051_039kon", "source_sha256": "c11de608011c4c9bd747dc2339aacbb83711bd8f82a08037fa8c21d8218a0319", "ja": "またやっちゃった……！", "zh": "我又搞砸了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1052_039kon", "source_sha256": "1813ee6fcc3ccc12b84e3bce72d9deaffaba18ff3c359b8a1441ed43a304df7d", "ja": "どうしてこうなの、私！\nお姉さんぶって、余計なこと言って……！", "zh": "为什么会这样，我真是的！\n还装姐姐多嘴多舌，说些多余的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1053_039kon", "source_sha256": "610fbcdb65cd2ab955c5324f2a6e761a885467e6ecc76fed8ce748fdf3d96ae5", "ja": "私だって腹くらい立つわよ！\nでもしょうがないじゃない！？　お仕事だもの！", "zh": "我也会生气的好吗！\n但有什么办法呢！？这是工作嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1055_039kon", "source_sha256": "fb65d44d844225e522b1cd4a3915063253a45549289833891d2a7bd7bfa3b47b", "ja": "あら、{$P$}？\nなになに？　あの番組の次の企画……？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}？\n什么什么？那个节目的下一个企划……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1056_039kon", "source_sha256": "aeac65ae905d0215e590584079f4177ffb28ad783980fcc0202905eb203d2eff", "ja": "……ランドセル？　もう、何よそれ！\nまったく、大人のレディをつかまえて失礼ね！", "zh": "……小学生书包？真是的，什么嘛！\n真是的，居然把我这个成熟女士当成小孩子，太失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1057_039kon", "source_sha256": "5ee9f47f00904efaa16ed728480d84289f53e8f79617d0287ed13b0f09caded9", "ja": "『この内容なので、このみさんが嫌なら断ります。\n遠慮しないでください』……。", "zh": "“毕竟是这种内容，如果木实姐不愿意的话我就拒绝掉。\n请不要客气”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1058_039kon", "source_sha256": "2bed4f6d70e13068c8b0a844e63dd14514fd82fe6897cf74800d02b1b074c379", "ja": "大人のレディ、か……。", "zh": "成熟的淑女，吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_143_1059_039kon", "source_sha256": "de5ef44abac9ab2162870ded0010185cd27f9375056a981e14bff9e707740f91", "ja": "…………はぁ。\n……お酒飲んで寝よ。", "zh": "…………唉。\n……喝点酒睡觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
